docs {
  Scenario: the window is open but the BRANCH is closed right now (branch hours are narrower than the window).
Expected: the clock does not start / does not accrue while the branch is closed.
Status: VERIFIED by unit test.

  Run 00 Base Setup first (same session) so the shared vars are available.
}
